WEBVTT

01:34.150 --> 01:34.190
Unable to connect to the internet.

01:34.150 --> 01:34.190
Unable to display page because computer

01:34.150 --> 01:34.190
is not connected to the internet.

01:34.490 --> 01:39.700
The carefully-laid plan to assassinate Laomoto Khan was discovered.

01:39.700 --> 01:43.410
NINJA Slayer slays the NINJA assassins sent after him.

01:43.410 --> 01:47.250
He is certain that the leak was the result of Nancy being captured.

01:47.540 --> 01:50.540
But then why was Nancy captured?

01:50.540 --> 01:52.550
To find out, we must return to yesterday.

01:52.550 --> 01:56.050
Everything is as MIYAMOTO MASASHI once said:

01:56.050 --> 02:00.550
Attack your emotions with a SASUMATA,
or be swept up in the MAELSTROM.

02:01.850 --> 02:04.560
STRANGER STRANGER

02:01.850 --> 02:04.560
THAN FICTION

02:05.560 --> 02:09.690
Oh, DŌMO. This is Truffle HOG, yes.

02:09.690 --> 02:10.940
It was bad info.

02:10.940 --> 02:12.900
When a stray bullet killed him,

02:12.900 --> 02:15.610
he fell on his keyboard.

02:15.610 --> 02:18.030
Nothing to do with the SYNDICATE.

02:18.030 --> 02:20.410
Yes, a trick of the natural sciences.

02:20.410 --> 02:22.870
Hmm? No, just one second.

02:24.240 --> 02:28.500
This SCOUT NINJA boasts a special NINJA NOSE.

02:28.960 --> 02:31.000
No, there's a NINJA SOUL here.

02:31.000 --> 02:32.340
It's on the other side.

02:32.340 --> 02:34.750
Yes, I can trace it.

02:36.760 --> 02:39.090
YEEART!

02:43.050 --> 02:45.850
There are no SŌKAI NINJA around there.

02:46.270 --> 02:48.180
And nothing suggests they might be.

02:48.180 --> 02:52.400
JUCCHUU HACKING says it's NINJA Slayer's hideout.

02:48.180 --> 02:52.400
NOTE: JUCCHUU HACKING is 90% successful.

02:52.400 --> 02:55.230
Morita

02:52.400 --> 02:55.230
DŌMO. I snuck into his room.

02:55.230 --> 02:58.900
It seems the NINJA SOUL's bearer has moved on already.

02:58.900 --> 03:02.740
It sure is an empty room, though.

03:02.740 --> 03:04.530
Well done.

03:04.530 --> 03:05.450
Yes.

03:06.580 --> 03:09.000
I will take over your ID.

03:09.000 --> 03:10.500
YEEART!

03:10.500 --> 03:14.790
WARLOCK slipped his own mind inside Truffle HOG's body!

03:14.790 --> 03:17.050
This is called FUDŌ NORIUTSURI JITSU.

03:14.790 --> 03:17.050
NOTE: This JITSU transfers REAL ESTATE.

03:21.130 --> 03:23.850
Okay, now it's time to begin,

03:23.850 --> 03:25.760
NINJA Slayer-SAN!

03:27.270 --> 03:33.230
The beginning of it all was the small kindness NINJA Slayer showed to Agata.

03:33.230 --> 03:36.980
When he threw Daigo out the window,

03:36.980 --> 03:39.940
INGAŌHŌ came back to haunt him in the worst possible way.

03:53.790 --> 03:56.630
Today, I have come to give you AISATSU.

03:56.960 --> 03:59.920
DŌMO. I am Baba YAGA.

04:02.220 --> 04:05.300
You're going to do something for me.

04:06.350 --> 04:09.020
Don't die here.

04:20.570 --> 04:22.740
Damn it, this is impossible!

04:22.740 --> 04:24.070
Inconceivable, even!

04:24.740 --> 04:27.330
I've brought the car around. It's time.

04:27.330 --> 04:29.620
They were highly-skilled NINJA!

04:29.620 --> 04:32.210
They couldn't have screwed up! It's impossible!

04:32.210 --> 04:35.460
We're getting out of here. Did you remove the memory devices?

04:35.460 --> 04:38.210
O-Of course. I'm not freaking out at all.

04:38.210 --> 04:39.250
Let's go.

04:42.340 --> 04:44.430
Yes, we'll head straight to the wharf.

04:44.430 --> 04:47.300
Yes, that's right. I trust you.

04:47.300 --> 04:49.260
The SHŌGI board isn't in CHECKMATE yet.

04:49.260 --> 04:53.770
<i>I didn't tell NINJA Slayer-SAN that the abandoned movie theater was my hideout.</i>

04:53.770 --> 04:56.060
<i>So I can't count on him to save me, huh?</i>

04:56.060 --> 05:00.190
As long as we can deal with this emergency, we can still win.

05:00.190 --> 05:02.360
They won't even think to come after us—

05:06.070 --> 05:06.910
What?

05:06.910 --> 05:08.740
It's him, WARLOCK-SAN!

05:10.950 --> 05:13.290
Impossible! It's too fast!

05:13.290 --> 05:14.290
This doesn't make sense!

05:15.250 --> 05:16.040
Wait.

05:16.500 --> 05:17.710
I'll handle this.

05:17.710 --> 05:20.880
DŌMO, HAJIMEMASHITE, BASILISK-SAN.

05:20.880 --> 05:22.550
I am NINJA Slayer.

05:22.550 --> 05:26.130
DŌMO, NINJA Slayer-SAN.
I am BASILISK.

05:26.130 --> 05:28.140
How did you learn about us?

05:28.140 --> 05:29.720
This is my answer!

05:33.140 --> 05:36.850
Go on. I'll kill him myself.

05:39.480 --> 05:40.230
YEEART!

05:42.190 --> 05:43.360
I'll run you over!

05:44.990 --> 05:45.820
YEEART!

05:45.820 --> 05:49.450
I should've killed you myself in the first place!

05:49.450 --> 05:51.660
Without letting those weaklings try!

05:51.870 --> 05:52.410
YEEART!

05:53.740 --> 05:56.870
You love murder as much as I do!

05:56.870 --> 05:58.620
You must be a true warrior, like me!

05:59.000 --> 06:01.960
Nothing else makes me so happy!

06:01.960 --> 06:07.720
Behold! His incredible DRIVING JITSU allows him to climb up the building's walls!

06:01.960 --> 06:07.720
NOTE: DRIVING is the art of using VEHICLES.

06:07.720 --> 06:08.970
YEEART!

06:13.060 --> 06:15.100
I'll crush your organs into a fine red mist,

06:15.100 --> 06:16.850
NINJA Slayer-SAN!

06:16.850 --> 06:17.440
YEEART!

06:17.440 --> 06:18.480
What?!

06:26.360 --> 06:29.780
Impressive, NINJA Slayer-SAN.

06:31.030 --> 06:31.820
YEEART!

06:31.820 --> 06:34.040
This is BASILISK's EVIL EYE!

06:34.040 --> 06:38.580
Without NINJA Slayer's NINJA sixth sense,
that would've been a fatal blow!

06:34.040 --> 06:38.580
NOTE: All NINJA possess at least six senses.

06:39.790 --> 06:41.830
You've thought this out.

06:41.830 --> 06:45.380
Where my opponent might be looking doesn't concern my EVIL EYE.

06:45.380 --> 06:47.760
I just have to glare, and it's all over!

06:47.760 --> 06:50.510
I decide if you live or die!

06:50.890 --> 06:54.560
But I cannot use it many times.

06:54.560 --> 06:55.100
YEEART!

06:56.810 --> 06:58.230
GWAAARGHH!

06:58.980 --> 07:00.190
GWARGH!

07:02.060 --> 07:05.940
The CATAPULT THROW, the ultimate secret AIKIDŌ technique!

07:06.480 --> 07:07.280
YEEART!

07:11.740 --> 07:16.660
I'll kill you here, and then kill Laomoto Khan!

07:17.240 --> 07:20.080
You can watch Khan's death from hell!

07:23.500 --> 07:26.050
How does my SURIKEN's poison taste?

07:26.050 --> 07:28.010
You can't even move!

07:28.010 --> 07:29.170
This is the end!

07:29.170 --> 07:31.470
YEEART!

07:31.470 --> 07:33.300
WASSHOI!

07:33.890 --> 07:34.930
YEEART!

07:36.680 --> 07:38.770
GWAARRGGH!

07:42.940 --> 07:46.440
What a terrifying man you are, NINJA Slayer-SAN!

07:47.360 --> 07:51.700
You defeated four assassins,
and the SHADOW GUILD's—

07:51.700 --> 07:54.530
Will you read your HAIKU, BASILISK-SAN?

07:54.780 --> 07:56.160
HAIKU...

07:56.620 --> 07:59.660
is for dogs who refuse to face their deaths!

07:59.660 --> 08:02.370
Your pity is nothing but arrogance!

08:02.370 --> 08:04.790
GWAARGHH!

08:05.670 --> 08:08.300
GWAARGHH!

08:08.840 --> 08:11.800
GWARGH!

08:13.720 --> 08:17.810
He ripped the rear-view mirrors off the bike and used them to reflect the beam!

08:17.810 --> 08:19.430
GWARGH!

08:20.930 --> 08:22.140
YEEART!

08:28.110 --> 08:33.150
DŌMO, Laomoto-SAN.
I am Truffle HOG.

08:33.150 --> 08:35.740
DŌMO, Truffle HOG-SAN.

08:35.740 --> 08:38.580
What will you do with that ugly woman?

08:38.780 --> 08:43.710
This woman tried to lure you and Dark NINJA-SAN out,

08:43.710 --> 08:46.040
so that she could kill you!

08:46.040 --> 08:48.500
She's in league with NINJA Slayer.

08:50.800 --> 08:53.590
In league with NINJA Slayer, huh?

08:54.680 --> 09:00.310
If you torture her, it will be easy to defeat NINJA Slayer-SAN.

09:01.060 --> 09:03.100
You're correct.

09:03.310 --> 09:04.560
Yes, and so—

09:04.560 --> 09:06.190
GWAAARGGHHH!

09:08.110 --> 09:10.320
Don't fail to find his real body.

09:10.570 --> 09:12.150
I will not.

09:14.400 --> 09:17.110
DŌMO. This is GATEKEEPER.

09:14.400 --> 09:17.110
NOTE: A GATEKEEPER is one who KEEPS GATES.

09:17.110 --> 09:18.870
I've taken care of things here, too.

09:19.370 --> 09:21.370
It's been taken care of.

09:21.370 --> 09:24.410
Perfect, as always.

09:31.590 --> 09:33.170
NINJA Slayer-SAN!

09:36.880 --> 09:40.260
Play with him a little, Dark NINJA-SAN.

09:40.260 --> 09:41.260
With pleasure.

09:41.470 --> 09:44.060
DŌMO. I am NINJA Slayer.

09:44.060 --> 09:44.560
YEEART!

09:47.060 --> 09:48.230
GWARGH!

09:51.940 --> 09:52.780
Damn!

09:52.780 --> 09:53.320
YEEA—

09:53.320 --> 09:54.650
Enough.

09:54.650 --> 09:58.950
Send him here. I'll play with him myself.

10:00.990 --> 10:04.120
DŌMO, NINJA Slayer-SAN.

10:04.120 --> 10:07.000
I am Laomoto Khan.

10:07.000 --> 10:10.960
First, I shall praise you for facing me.

10:10.960 --> 10:13.250
YEEEAAAAAARRRT!

10:13.250 --> 10:16.720
HASTE... makes... WASTE!

10:13.250 --> 10:16.720
NOTE: This, too, is the wisdom of the great MIYAMOTO MASASHI!

10:16.760 --> 10:16.800
NEKOSOGI Fund CEO

10:16.840 --> 10:16.880
Laomoto Khan

10:21.600 --> 10:26.980
You need to take a broader view, and not simply focus on what's in front of you,

10:26.980 --> 10:29.060
NINJA Slayer-SAN.

10:33.770 --> 10:36.400
Stand, NINJA Slayer-SAN.

10:37.570 --> 10:38.110
YEEART!

10:44.700 --> 10:45.950
GWAAARGH!

10:53.000 --> 10:56.800
Exhaustion and injuries from his many battles, as well as the poison,

10:56.800 --> 11:00.470
leaves NINJA Slayer unable to deal with Dark NINJA's techniques!

10:58.340 --> 11:00.470
GWAAARRRGGGGHHHH!

11:00.470 --> 11:03.300
Come along now, Dark NINJA!

11:03.300 --> 11:04.010
YEEART!

11:07.520 --> 11:09.690
That was most entertaining.

11:09.690 --> 11:13.150
I shall leave this pathetic loser a present!

11:16.610 --> 11:18.110
Laomoto...

11:23.660 --> 11:26.290
NOTE: He is NOT going to shout KHAAAAAN.

13:03.300 --> 13:04.800
Morita-SAN?

13:04.800 --> 13:07.720
DŌMO, Agata-SAN.

13:07.720 --> 13:09.180
DŌMO.

13:09.850 --> 13:14.640
Attack your emotions with a SASUMATA,
or be swept up in the MAELSTROM.

13:14.640 --> 13:20.650
What would MIYAMOTO MASASHI say if he could see them now?

13:20.650 --> 13:23.610
Morita-SAN, hang in there!

13:23.610 --> 13:25.070
DŌMO.

13:25.070 --> 13:27.410
There's a medkit in my room...

13:28.990 --> 13:29.870
Right!

13:30.280 --> 13:33.290
The unexpected kindness he'd shown the day before.

13:33.290 --> 13:37.880
Was it a failure that brought him to the brink of death?

13:38.170 --> 13:42.420
I have to go... to the last battle...

13:43.130 --> 13:48.550
Or is it the last flickering light from PANDORA's box,

13:43.130 --> 13:48.550
NOTE: PANDORA was a renowned GREEK NINJA.

13:48.550 --> 13:51.640
the only thing keeping him human?
